🎬 Krea 2 Character LoRA: Full Dataset + Training Walkthrough

I've been seeing a ton of you in the Discord struggling to get a clean Krea 2 character LoRA trained, asking the same questions over and over. This video covers exactly how I've been successfully training Krea 2 LoRAs, start to finish. Building a dataset from a single reference photo, captioning it inside Ostris ai-toolkit, and the full training configuration.

By the end you'll have the workflow to go from one reference photo to a trained character LoRA that holds up across different poses and angles with strong character consistency across generations.

